@startuml
title ExitPass POS Server Fiscal Issuance Failure and Retry Flow

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam participantPadding 24
skinparam boxPadding 12

participant "Central PMS" as PMS
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Retry queue /\ncontrolled retry" as Retry
participant "Channel / terminal" as Channel
participant "Supervisor" as Supervisor
participant "Reconciliation" as Recon

PMS -> PMS : Verified payment finality\nrecorded
PMS -> POS : Request SI issuance
POS -x PMS : Failure or timeout
PMS -> PMS : Do not issue\nExitAuthorization yet
PMS -> Retry : Create fiscal issuance\nexception/retry item
Retry -> Channel : Message customer/operator:\npayment received,\nSI pending,\nexit not yet available

loop Controlled retry
    Retry -> POS : Retry SI issuance
end

alt SI issuance succeeds
    POS --> Retry : SI identity/status\nand digital SI URL if applicable
    Retry --> PMS : Fiscal reference
    PMS -> PMS : Record fiscal reference\nthen authorization may proceed
else Manual release allowed by policy
    Retry -> Supervisor : Request approval
    Supervisor --> Retry : Approve with reason
    Retry -> Recon : Incident tag +\nreconciliation tag
    Retry --> PMS : Controlled exception closure
else No approved closure
    Retry -> Channel : Continue pending\nor operational escalation
end

note over PMS,Retry
Payment is not automatically reversed.
ExitAuthorization is blocked until SI issuance succeeds
or a controlled exception is approved.
end note

@enduml
